  "notes": "{劣|おと}る is an intransitive godan verb meaning to be inferior or fall short in comparison.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- No transitive pair\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{劣|おと}る: to be inferior to ~\n- 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{劣|おと}らず: not inferior to ~, equally\n- ⟦{勝|まさ}る→勝る：11848_masaru⟧⟦とも→とも：noentry⟧{劣|おと}らない: at least as good as (lit: even if surpassing, not inferior)\n- ⟦どちら→どちら：00927_dochira⟧⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧{劣|おと}らず: both equally (good)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{劣|おと}っている describes an ongoing state of being inferior.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{優|すぐ}れる→優れる：02119_sugureru⟧: to excel, be superior\n- ⟦{勝|まさ}る→勝る：11848_masaru⟧: to surpass, exceed\n\nThe negative form {劣|おと}らない is frequently used to express equality or comparable quality.",
